      <br><br>
      <strong>2. Market regime shift:</strong> The model was trained on a low-volatility bull market; a different regime arrived. Defense: walk-forward rolling retrain (<code>walkforward_sim.py --rolling_retrain</code>) and a GMM regime overlay to scale exposure when the model's regime isn't represented in its training history.
      <br><br>
      <strong>3. Feature decay:</strong> The specific technical features (MA gap, RSI-14) have been arbed away. Defense: add new features from less commoditized sources — order flow imbalance (L2 data), earnings revision momentum, or news sentiment — and re-select with walk-forward feature importance.
    </div>
  </details>
